            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "Real gross domestic product (GDP) increased at an annual rate of 3.4 percent in the fourth quarter of\n2023 (table 1), according to the \"third\" estimate"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "第二次估计为 3.2%，因此第三次估计较第二次估计上修。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d1f8e4dfb30c43e09540625d06aeeb41",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 760,
              "character_end": 825,
              "page": 1
            },
            "quotation_match": "exact",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "In the second estimate, the increase in real GDP was 3.2 percent."
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "上修主要来自消费者支出和非住宅固定投资的上调，部分被私人库存投资的下调所抵消。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d1f8e4dfb30c43e09540625d06aeeb41",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 826,
              "character_end": 1009,
              "page": 1
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The update primarily reflected upward revisions to consumer spending and nonresidential fixed\ninvestment that were partly offset by a downward revision to private inventory investment"
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "上修并非全面上调：私人库存投资的下调部分抵消了消费和非住宅投资的上修，因此净上修（约 0.2 个百分点，需计算确认）小于各分项上修幅度。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d1f8e4dfb30c43e09540625d06aeeb41",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 826,
